# Build inputs that never belong in version control.
node_modules/
lib-test/
*.tgz
overlay.yml
.DS_Store

# `lib/` is intentionally tracked here, unlike an upstream npm package: DSH loads
# `lib/index.js` and nothing else, and this vendored copy is mounted through
# `link:` with no build step. Committing the bundle is what makes the checked-in
# tree runnable and what keeps `git diff` honest about the shipped code.
# Rebuild it with `pnpm run prepare` after touching `src/`.
